From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shiny <owner@shinychang.net>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 07:12:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: preview the selected tab in Go to Anything

- Beside the list, Go to Anything shows the selected entry's title and
  address, with a picture of the page when it is an open tab.
- Tab thumbnails are captured on Mac too (kTabHoverCardImages on), so
  the preview has an image to show. A tab restored from the last
  session keeps its icon instead, because observing its thumbnail
  would load it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BYkQJUafT3hpFT1kBmDgzX
